{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果即將推出的iPhone 18和iPhone 18e兩款機型再次遭遇生產延遲。來自微博的爆料者「定焦數碼」稱，這兩款機型目前均尚未進入大規模量產階段，量產啓動時間已從此前預計的10月下旬推遲到2027年元旦前後。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588236.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:04:02.557958+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:21.865168+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:21.865168+00:00","content_hash":"f1851880e433f9d4fe26451d88d5276d92cd215d1534d2a34c9cecef63097d95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}